        "instructionsHtml": "Section 3<p>Listen and answer questions 21–30.</p>",
        "groups": [
          {
            "id": "part-3-group-1",
            "type": "mcq",
            "selectCount": 1,
            "rubricHtml": "<h3>Questions 21–24</h3><p>Choose the correct letter, <strong>A</strong>, <strong>B</strong> or <strong>C</strong>.</p><p><strong>Woolly mammoths on St Paul's Island</strong></p>",
            "questions": [
              {
                "number": 21,
                "textHtml": "How will Rosie and Martin introduce their presentation?",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "letter": "A",
                    "textHtml": "with a drawing of woolly mammoths in their natural habitat"
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "B",
                    "textHtml": "with a timeline showing when woolly mammoths lived"
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "C",
                    "textHtml": "with a video clip about woolly mammoths"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "number": 22,
                "textHtml": "What was surprising about the mammoth tooth found by Russell Graham?",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "letter": "A",
                    "textHtml": "It was still embedded in the mammoth's jawbone."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "B",
                    "textHtml": "It was from an unknown species of mammoth."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "C",
                    "textHtml": "It was not as old as mammoth remains from elsewhere."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "number": 23,
                "textHtml": "The students will use an animated diagram to demonstrate how the mammoths",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "letter": "A",
                    "textHtml": "became isolated on the island."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "B",
                    "textHtml": "spread from the island to other areas."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "C",
                    "textHtml": "coexisted with other animals on the island."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "number": 24,
                "textHtml": "According to Martin, what is unusual about the date of the mammoths' extinction on the island?",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "letter": "A",
                    "textHtml": "how exact it is"
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "B",
                    "textHtml": "how early it is"
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "C",
                    "textHtml": "how it was established"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
